# NASAQ: the app switcher (nasaq-altwatch) and the Caps Lock watcher
# (nasaq-keywatch) read key state from the kernel, because Hyprland never
# reports a modifier's release. The logged-in user gets read access to the
# KEYBOARD event devices only (not mice, touchpads or tablets).
KERNEL=="event*", SUBSYSTEM=="input", ENV{ID_INPUT_KEYBOARD}=="?*", TAG+="uaccess"
